{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Recall the formula for the derivative of $\\arcsin(x)$:\n\n$\\dfrac{d}{dx}[\\arcsin(x)]=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $f'(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nf'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arcsin\\left(\\dfrac x3\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\dfrac x3\\right)^2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac x3\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{3\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{x^2}{9}}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we evaluate $f'(x)$ at $\\blueD{x=1}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nf'(\\blueD 1)\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{3\\sqrt{1-\\dfrac{(\\blueD 1)^2}{9}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{3\\sqrt{\\dfrac89}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, $f'(1)=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt 8}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$f(x)=\\arcsin\\left(\\dfrac x3\\right)$\n\n$f'\\left(1\\right)=$ [[☃ expression 1]]\n\n*Use an exact expression.*","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":0,"simplify":false,"value":"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
